---
---
<section id="skills" class="w-full px-8 py-32 md:px-16 bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-24">
      <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-6">
        Skills that fuel my<br/>passion
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 max-w-md mx-auto">
        Passionate Creative Developer, dedicated to crafting innovative solutions and exceptional digital experiences through modern technologies.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Skills Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="bg-[#1a1a1a] p-8 rounded-3xl flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
           <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400">⚛️</div>
           <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-green-400">🤖</div>
           <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-blue-600">🍏</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-2">Mobile App Development</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Creating cross-platform and native mobile apps with sleek designs and robust functionality using React Native, Flutter, iOS, and Android.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="bg-[#1a1a1a] p-8 rounded-3xl flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
           <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-orange-500">☁️</div>
           <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-blue-500">🐳</div>
           <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white">⚙️</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-2">DevOps & Cloud</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Experienced in deploying, automating, and managing infrastructure using AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, and CI/CD pipelines.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="bg-[#1a1a1a] p-8 rounded-3xl flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
           <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-yellow-500">🐍</div>
           <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-blue-500">TS</div>
           <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-red-500">G</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-2">Programming Languages</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Proficient in problem-solving and applying programming languages (Python, TypeScript, Go) to implement efficient logic.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="bg-[#1a1a1a] p-8 rounded-3xl flex flex-col gap-6 md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
           <div class="px-4 py-2 bg-gray-800 rounded-full text-sm text-gray-300">Linux</div>
           <div class="px-4 py-2 bg-gray-800 rounded-full text-sm text-gray-300">Networking</div>
           <div class="px-4 py-2 bg-gray-800 rounded-full text-sm text-gray-300">System Design</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-2">Core Computer Science Concepts</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
            Demonstrating a strong foundation in core computer science principles, including problem-solving, system design, and efficient computing techniques.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Card 5 -->
      <div class="bg-[#1a1a1a] p-8 rounded-3xl flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
           <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-800 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">💾</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-2">Database Management</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Designing and managing databases (PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis) to ensure secure and efficient data storage and retrieval.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
